  _callId: Hey it's me
  _lines:
  - _text: "Hey, it's me.\n\nIt's important \u2014 no time to explain, something
      serious is happening outside. Stay inside and stay safe.\n\nBy the way, are
      you okay? Last night you drank a lot\u2026 do you even remember who you are?
      Hahaha, just kidding, bro.\n\nAlright, I\u2019ll come to you as soon as I can.
      And remember, don\u2019t go outside."
